These tests exist and presumably pass. The live proof still fails. So the hole must be outside these. Let me think about the live shape: player 47 has 1 naked planet beside one holding 1,225 units. Perhaps this account has only 2 planets and the naked one is a *fresh colony* where the building planner wants the shipyard but the colony's own resources are 0 — and no transfer happens because Transfer planner requires a target with... hmm.

